@model SanaatMetal.Areas.Admin.Controllers.LoginVm
@{ Layout = "_AuthLayout"; ViewData["Title"] = "ورود به پنل مدیریت"; }
<form method="post" asp-action="Login">
    @if (TempData["LoginInfo"] is string info) { <div class="alert alert-success small py-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle ic"></i>@info</div> }
    <div asp-validation-summary="All" class="text-warning small mb-2"></div>
    <input type="hidden" asp-for="ReturnUrl" />
    <div class="mb-3">
        <label class="form-label" asp-for="UserName">نام کاربری یا ایمیل</label>
        <input class="form-control ltr" asp-for="UserName" autocomplete="username" autofocus maxlength="256" />
    </div>
    <div class="mb-3">
        <label class="form-label" asp-for="Password">رمز عبور</label>
        <input class="form-control ltr" asp-for="Password" autocomplete="current-password" maxlength="128" />
    </div>
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4">
        <div class="form-check">
            <input class="form-check-input" asp-for="RememberMe" />
            <label class="form-check-label small" asp-for="RememberMe">مرا به خاطر بسپار</label>
        </div>
        <a asp-action="ForgotPassword" class="small text-warning">رمز را فراموش کرده‌اید؟</a>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-a-accent w-100 py-2 fs-6" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-left ic"></i>ورود</button>
</form>
